On our feet, with our own claws.

00:21:26.520 --> 00:21:27.200
in this world.

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:29.560
Both Alba and I.

00:21:30.630 --> 00:21:31.070
That's all.

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:33.490
Just to stand firm.
